with an aftertaste of fish.

00:02:23.845 --> 00:02:27.013
Which is exactly what I want
my styrofoam to taste like.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.682
- You could probably build
a building with this.

00:02:28.682 --> 00:02:29.975
